{"id":"2e4aa3df9477aa6f","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-tree-ordinal.md","title":"内涵式树序数","display":"df-tree-ordinal — 内涵式树序数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-tree-ordinal","aliases":["72-df-tree-ordinal"],"display":"df-tree-ordinal — 内涵式树序数","chapter":"III","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Defs.2.1,2.3; induction principle2.5; print154; PDF166","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","source_statement_status":"checked-against-book","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-tree-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-tree-ordinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tree-ordinal — 内涵式树序数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Defs.2.1,2.3; induction principle2.5; print154; PDF166"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-book"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在 ZFC 元理论中工作。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为自然数有限序列集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\preceq t\">\\(s\\preceq t\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 的初段，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s^\\frown t\">\\(s^\\frown t\\)</span> 表示串接。</li>\n<li>语法对象采用集合编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=\\langle T,c\\rangle\">\\(\\alpha=\\langle T,c\\rangle\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:T\\to\\{0,1,2\\}\">\\(c:T\\to\\{0,1,2\\}\\)</span>。三个标签分别编码零、后继和形式极限；不把这些语法对象与 von Neumann 序数等同。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\)</span> 为任意集合；下式定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L\\)</span>、子树算子以及关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Omega\\coloneqq\\{\\langle T,c\\rangle:\\;&amp;\\epsilon\\in T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\land\\ c:T\\to\\{0,1,2\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ \\forall t\\in T\\ \\forall s\\preceq t\\ (s\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ \\forall s\\in T\\ \\bigl(\\{n\\in\\omega:s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\}=\\begin{cases}\\varnothing,&amp;c(s)=0,\\\\\\{0\\},&amp;c(s)=1,\\\\\\omega,&amp;c(s)=2\\end{cases}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ \\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ \\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (f\\upharpoonright n\\notin T)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Omega\\coloneqq\\{\\langle T,c\\rangle:\\;&amp;\\epsilon\\in T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\land\\ c:T\\to\\{0,1,2\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ \\forall t\\in T\\ \\forall s\\preceq t\\ (s\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ \\forall s\\in T\\ \\bigl(\\{n\\in\\omega:s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\}=\\begin{cases}\\varnothing,&amp;c(s)=0,\\\\\\{0\\},&amp;c(s)=1,\\\\\\omega,&amp;c(s)=2\\end{cases}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ \\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ \\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (f\\upharpoonright n\\notin T)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0\\coloneqq\\langle\\{\\epsilon\\},\\{\\langle\\epsilon,0\\rangle\\}\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf0\\coloneqq\\langle\\{\\epsilon\\},\\{\\langle\\epsilon,0\\rangle\\}\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S(\\langle T,c\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\{\\epsilon\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown s:s\\in T\\},\\{\\langle\\epsilon,1\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown s,c(s)\\rangle:s\\in T\\}\\right\\rangle\\quad(\\langle T,c\\rangle\\in\\Omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf S(\\langle T,c\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\{\\epsilon\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown s:s\\in T\\},\\{\\langle\\epsilon,1\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown s,c(s)\\rangle:s\\in T\\}\\right\\rangle\\quad(\\langle T,c\\rangle\\in\\Omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L((\\langle T_n,c_n\\rangle)_{n\\in\\omega})\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\{\\epsilon\\}\\cup\\{\\langle n\\rangle^\\frown s:n\\in\\omega\\land s\\in T_n\\},\\{\\langle\\epsilon,2\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle n\\rangle^\\frown s,c_n(s)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\land s\\in T_n\\}\\right\\rangle\\quad((\\langle T_n,c_n\\rangle)_{n\\in\\omega}\\in\\Omega^\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf L((\\langle T_n,c_n\\rangle)_{n\\in\\omega})\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\{\\epsilon\\}\\cup\\{\\langle n\\rangle^\\frown s:n\\in\\omega\\land s\\in T_n\\},\\{\\langle\\epsilon,2\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle n\\rangle^\\frown s,c_n(s)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\land s\\in T_n\\}\\right\\rangle\\quad((\\langle T_n,c_n\\rangle)_{n\\in\\omega}\\in\\Omega^\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle T,c\\rangle\\!\\upharpoonright_s\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\{t:s^\\frown t\\in T\\},\\{\\langle t,c(s^\\frown t)\\rangle:s^\\frown t\\in T\\}\\right\\rangle\\quad(\\langle T,c\\rangle\\in\\Omega\\land s\\in T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle T,c\\rangle\\!\\upharpoonright_s\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\{t:s^\\frown t\\in T\\},\\{\\langle t,c(s^\\frown t)\\rangle:s^\\frown t\\in T\\}\\right\\rangle\\quad(\\langle T,c\\rangle\\in\\Omega\\land s\\in T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\prec\\beta\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\alpha\\in\\Omega\\land\\beta\\in\\Omega\\land\\exists T,c\\ \\exists s\\in T\\setminus\\{\\epsilon\\}\\ (\\beta=\\langle T,c\\rangle\\land\\alpha=\\beta\\!\\upharpoonright_s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\prec\\beta\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\alpha\\in\\Omega\\land\\beta\\in\\Omega\\land\\exists T,c\\ \\exists s\\in T\\setminus\\{\\epsilon\\}\\ (\\beta=\\langle T,c\\rangle\\land\\alpha=\\beta\\!\\upharpoonright_s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Fairtlough–Wainer，第 III 章 Definitions 2.1、2.3 及 induction principle 2.5，印刷 p.154 / PDF p.166；本次已复核原页。这里把原书的内涵式构造树显式编码为带标签的自然数序列树；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 是严格子树关系，不是全序。形式极限允许任意分支序列，尚不要求结构化条件。</p>\n<p>良定义性：根标签唯一决定构造分支，子树唯一确定；后继和可数极限构造保持无无限分支。树秩沿严格子树下降，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 良基；后续递归在此良基关系上进行。已核对定义及编码对应；没有把全体语法树声明为同一个外延序数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"s\\preceq t","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"s^\\frown t","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha=\\langle T,c\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"c:T\\to\\{0,1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Omega\\coloneqq\\{\\langle T,c\\rangle:\\;&\\epsilon\\in T\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}\\ \\land\\ c:T\\to\\{0,1,2\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\ \\forall t\\in T\\ \\forall s\\preceq t\\ (s\\in T)\\\\\n&\\land\\ \\forall s\\in T\\ \\bigl(\\{n\\in\\omega:s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\}=\\begin{cases}\\varnothing,&c(s)=0,\\\\\\{0\\},&c(s)=1,\\\\\\omega,&c(s)=2\\end{cases}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\ \\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ \\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (f\\upharpoonright n\\notin T)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf0\\coloneqq\\langle\\{\\epsilon\\},\\{\\langle\\epsilon,0\\rangle\\}\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf S(\\langle T,c\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\{\\epsilon\\}\\cup\\{\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown s:s\\in T\\},\\{\\langle\\epsilon,1\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle0\\rangle^\\frown s,c(s)\\rangle:s\\in T\\}\\right\\rangle\\quad(\\langle T,c\\rangle\\in\\Omega).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf L((\\langle T_n,c_n\\rangle)_{n\\in\\omega})\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\{\\epsilon\\}\\cup\\{\\langle n\\rangle^\\frown s:n\\in\\omega\\land s\\in T_n\\},\\{\\langle\\epsilon,2\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle n\\rangle^\\frown s,c_n(s)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\land s\\in T_n\\}\\right\\rangle\\quad((\\langle T_n,c_n\\rangle)_{n\\in\\omega}\\in\\Omega^\\omega).","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle T,c\\rangle\\!\\upharpoonright_s\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\{t:s^\\frown t\\in T\\},\\{\\langle t,c(s^\\frown t)\\rangle:s^\\frown t\\in T\\}\\right\\rangle\\quad(\\langle T,c\\rangle\\in\\Omega\\land s\\in T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha\\prec\\beta\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\alpha\\in\\Omega\\land\\beta\\in\\Omega\\land\\exists T,c\\ \\exists s\\in T\\setminus\\{\\epsilon\\}\\ (\\beta=\\langle T,c\\rangle\\land\\alpha=\\beta\\!\\upharpoonright_s).","display":true},{"tex":"\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec","display":false}],"bytes":3327,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal|df-tree-ordinal — 内涵式树序数]]"},{"id":"8e620b5020310301","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal]]；$\\alpha\\in\\Omega$，$n,k\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"fcd2431dc7fa995d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal]]；$\\alpha\\in\\Omega$，$n\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"e7432b8a48a477c7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal]]；$\\alpha\\in\\Omega$，$n\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"1c0b1d31927046ab","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"树序数编码及严格子树关系见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal]]，有限前驱集见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-predecessor]]。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal]]"},{"id":"ee59458b6acb7c90","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L,\\prec$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal]]。$\\alp